<!-- Routes. noupdate="1" so that a page edited in the Website Builder is not
     overwritten by a module update, which is the whole point of shipping the
     content as editable views rather than as controller templates.

     "/" and "/contactus" are absent on purpose: the website module already owns
     those routes, so data/website_theme_apply.xml writes our arch onto its
     views instead. -->
